  "goodToKnow": "Die Folie is a thin sheet of film or foil: die Alufolie, die Frischhaltefolie (cling film), die Plastikfolie. It's also a presentation slide, from the overhead projector era of transparencies: die nächste Folie, ein Foliensatz (slide deck). Pronounced FOH-lye, three syllables in the plural: Fo-li-en. Don't confuse it with French folie (madness). Plural: die Folien."
